Purpose: GPU time: the fragment jobs of a pass without attachments are bounded to the union of its draws' scissor boxes instead of the render area (vkd3d-proton's 65536x65536 x 256-layer passes: 2.9 s -> 8.2 ms of GPU time); falls back to the full area for multi-viewport prerast, ClearAttachments and ExecuteCommands; PANVK_NO_NOATT_FRAG_BBOX=1 disables
